display_name = "Road Rager"
role = "Flings a spinning hubcap that slices through every zombie on its way out and again on its way back. From the hip it carves a wide loop to the right; aim down sights to throw it straight out and back down one line. Catch it and it slots straight back in, so you never run dry (a catch mid-reload cuts the reload short). Four zombies in one throw is a pile-up: the hubcap turns gold and hits 50% harder for the rest of its flight."
